      "NamespaceHash": "F44EA0DD45B4EBD74576E6B6181F7DDD",
      "Source": "Hold Reload Key/Button to open the mode select UI.<#RN#><#RN#>Basic Transfer<#RN#>- Press Secondary Attack to set a structure as a source inventory.<#RN#>- Press Primary Attack to transfer everything from the source to the target.<#RN#><#RN#>Advanced Transfer<#RN#>- Primary Attack to open Transfer UI.<#RN#>- Secondary Attack to send presets to target Transfer Control Unit.<#RN#><#RN#>Inventory Assistant<#RN#>- Primary Attack to open Inventory Assistant UI.<#RN#>- Secondary Attack to toggle activation.<#RN#>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"按住装弹键/按钮打开模式选择界面。<#RN#><#RN#>基础转移<#RN#>- 按下次要攻击将一个结构设为来源库存。<#RN#>- 按下主要攻击将来源库存中的所有物品转移到目标。<#RN#><#RN#>高级转移<#RN#>- 主要攻击打开转移界面。<#RN#>- 次要攻击将预设发送到目标转移控制单元。<#RN#><#RN#>库存助手<#RN#>- 主要攻击打开库存助手界面。<#RN#>- 次要攻击切换激活状态。<#RN#>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"3789698681"}
